<title>SWEDEN: Sandvik forms joint venture with India's CTCL.</title>
<headline>Sandvik forms joint venture with India's CTCL.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Sandvik AB said it and Indian pipe maker Choksi Tube Company Ltd (CTCL) agreed in principle to form a joint venture in India to make extruded, seamless steel pipes.</p>
<p>The venture will be called Sandvik Choksi Private Ltd and Sandvik will have a 51 percent stake.</p>
</text>
